message: "If you use Uriel Forge in research, software assurance, or scholarly workflow development, please cite this software."
title: "Uriel Forge"
abstract: >-
  Uriel Forge is an offline-first, evidence-bound research development and
  assurance toolkit for project provenance, data readiness, claim-evidence
  tracing, integrity audits, submission preparation, and verifiable milestone
  closure.
